    <div class="section-label">02 · Competitive Landscape</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">What Competitors Are Doing — India & International</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">
      The India seller coaching market is creator-led, fragmented, and lacks a dominant category winner. Internationally, the Amazon FBA coaching space is far more mature — and it gives us a clear 3–5 year roadmap of where India is heading.
    </p>

    <div class="grid-2">
      <div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-size:18px; margin-bottom:20px; color:var(--text);">🇮🇳 India Market</h3>
        <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:14px;">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:8px;">
            <h3>KonBusiness</h3>
            <span class="badge badge-coral">Direct Competitor</span>
          </div>
          <p>3-course bundle covering Amazon + Flipkart + Meesho. Priced at ₹1,999 with 162 videos and monthly Zoom Q&A. Heavy focus on bundling value. Runs Meta and YouTube ads. Their hook: volume of content + live interaction.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:14px;">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:8px;">
