            <span class="badge badge-amber">Fragmented Pool</span>
          </div>
          <p>30–50 active Hindi ecom creator-coaches on Instagram with 5K–200K followers. Most operate at ₹999–₹2,999. No clear brand differentiation. Primary content: income screenshots, order dashboards, "realistic income" Reels.</p>
