          <p>Premium institutional course at ₹34,999 for a 2-month certification program. Targets students seeking credentials, not bootstrapped sellers. Not a direct competitor but sets an upper price anchor.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-size:18px; margin-bottom:20px; color:var(--text);">🌍 International (US/Global)</h3>
        <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:14px;">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:8px;">
            <h3>Amazing Selling Machine (ASM)</h3>
            <span class="badge badge-gold">Market Leader</span>
          </div>
          <p>The category-defining Amazon FBA course at $2,997 (or 6×$997). Uses a full webinar + email + high-production VSL funnel. Generates hundreds of documented student success stories. Live cohort model. This is the benchmark India will move toward.</p>
        </div>
