        </div>
        <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:14px;">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:8px;">
            <h3>Jungle Scout Academy</h3>
            <span class="badge badge-teal">Ecosystem Model</span>
          </div>
          <p>Same bundled model — course + tool. Focuses heavily on data-driven selling frameworks. Content is modular and research-first. Used as a retention mechanism for their SaaS tool subscribers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:8px;">
            <h3>Ezra Firestone / Smart Marketer</h3>
            <span class="badge badge-coral">Community Model</span>
          </div>
          <p>Sells courses at $997–$1,997 but makes them entry points into high-ticket mastermind groups ($5K–$15K/year). The course is the top of an ascension ladder. This is the most profitable model per student acquired and the direction India's market is heading.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="notice-box" style="margin-top:28px;">
      <strong>Key Strategic Observation:</strong> The US market is 3–5 years ahead. India's top ecom coaches will move toward the ascension ladder model (entry offer → ₹2,999 course → ₹15,000 group coaching → ₹60,000+ mastermind) within 24–36 months. Being early to this model in India is the real opportunity for you.
    </div>
  </div>
